     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"rtl\">(פורסם גם ב: <a href=\"http://r-israel.com/2016/08/202\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-israel.com/2016/08/202&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496792041000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1SDLKVc6cPYuhO5nUguDiR\">http://r-israel.com/2016/08/202</a>)</div><div dir=\"rtl\"><br></div><div dir=\"rtl\">שלום כולם,</div><div dir=\"rtl\">חשבתי שיעניין את חלקכם סדנת ה-R הבאה שמתארגנת בנובמבר על <span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px\">next generation sequencing</span></div><div style=\"direction:rtl\"><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">באתר הסדנה ניתן למצוא פרטים ולהרשם.<br><a href=\"http://rbioc.net.technion.ac.il/\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);background:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rbioc.net.technion.ac.il/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496792041000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1-s1ZSayQLj31BFRKAJwef\">http://rbioc.net.technion.ac.il/</a></p><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">הנה גם יש קישור <a href=\"http://rbioc.net.technion.ac.il/registration/\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);background:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rbioc.net.technion.ac.il/registration/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496792041000&amp;usg=AOvVaw273Z4C97nVNSQubk4pVCxR\">ישיר להרשמה</a>.</p><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;text-decoration:underline;background:transparent\"><strong style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">מובאים פה עיקרי הפרטים:</strong></span></p><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">This workshop provides an introduction to the <a href=\"https://www.r-project.org/about.html\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);background:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.r-project.org/about.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496792041000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0bdTgG5Cv1DExNgNrGi0YM\">R language</a> and environment for statistical computing and graphics, as well as introduction to next generation sequence (NGS) analysis data using<a href=\"http://www.bioconductor.org/\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);background:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.bioconductor.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496792041000&amp;usg=AOvVaw142o-qvcdVYmV5aho7Hsbs\">Bioconductor</a> tools. People who are interested in, or already working with, next-generation sequencing are welcome to apply. Participants are expected to have basic knowledge in programming and statistics. The workshop is aimed to train the participants to independently perform NGS analysis including data manipulation, differential analysis, annotation and reporting. The workshop will combine lectures and hands-on exercises.</p><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\"></span></p><h2 style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">Lecturers</h2><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><b style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">Martin Morgan, PhD.</b><br>Director, R Bioconductor. Department of Biostatistics and Bioinformatics<br>Roswell Park Cancer Institute.</p><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><b style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">Haim Bar, PhD.</b><br>Assistant Professor, Statistics. UCONN University of Connecticut.</p><h2 style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">Dates</h2><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">November 20-22/2016</p><h2 style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">Venue</h2><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">Pre-Academic Education Center.<br>The Technion – Israel Institute of Technology.<br>Haifa, Israel.</p><h2 style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"></h2><h2 style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">Organizers</h2><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><strong style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">Dr. Guy Horev</strong><br>Bioinformatics Knowledge Unit (BKU)<br>Lorry I. Lokey Interdisciplinary Center<br>for Life Sciences &amp; Engineering</p><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><strong style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">Dr. Michael Shmoish</strong><br>Head<br>Bioinformatics Knowledge Unit (BKU)<br>Lorry I. Lokey Interdisciplinary Center<br>for Life Sciences &amp; Engineering</p><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><strong style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">Prof. Yael Mandel-Gutfreund</strong><br>Director<br>Bioinformatics Knowledge Unit (BKU)<br>Lorry I. Lokey Interdisciplinary Center<br>for Life Sciences &amp; Engineering</p><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><strong style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">Shira Sagee</strong><br>Administrative Executive<br>Lorry I. Lokey Interdisciplinary Center<br>for Life Sciences &amp; Engineering</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n"
